16. Real Production Example
Example:
MySQL database
Needs persistent data.
Storage architecture:
MySQL Pod
    ↓
PVC (10Gi)
    ↓
PV
    ↓
Storage (NFS / Cloud Disk)
Now if pod crashes:
New Pod created
     ↓
Attaches same PVC
     ↓
Data remains safe
